        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bohan Hyland & Associates are delighted to present Apartment 1, The Thomas House to market. This two-bedroom, one-bathroom first floor apartment comes to market with no onward chain providing a quick turnaround for a willing buyer and is presented in great condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to first/second time buyers and investors alike. No. 1 is ideally located at 86/87 Thomas Street close to all local amenities (shops, schools, pubs, gyms, restaurants, cafes, bus routes, LUAS) and is within walking distance of Dublin City Centre. Vicar Street Venue is across the road.\r\n\r\nThis apartment briefly comprises of a light filled open plan living room/kitchen space with a large window overlooking Thomas Street, two bedrooms, one bathrooms and storage cupboard. Many additional benefits include dual aspect, electric storage heating, balcony area and central location to name but a few.\r\n\r\n2026 Service Charge: €1,748\r\n\r\nTo view this property, call Shane Hanevy today on 01 491 3000."
      },
